    <name>Reversing Falls - Stonehammer Geopark (Saint John, NB)</name>
    <cmt>&lt;img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Reversing_Falls_Bridge_in_2026.jpg/250px-Reversing_Falls_Bridge_in_2026.jpg"&gt;
The Reversing Falls are a series of rapids on the Saint John River, located in Saint John, New Brunswick, Canada, where the river runs through a narrow gorge before emptying into the Bay of Fundy.
