  <wpt lat="44.744216585531831" lon="-81.136715663596988">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-06-27T16:54:51Z</time>
    <name>Wiarton Willie Statue (Wiarton, ON)</name>
    <cmt>&lt;img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Wiarton_Willie_Park_%2847508970351%29.jpg/960px-Wiarton_Willie_Park_%2847508970351%29.jpg"&gt;
Every February 2nd, anticipation fills the air as people from all corners of the globe eagerly await the prediction from our famed groundhog. With all eyes on Wiarton Willie, the question lingers: will he cast a shadow, foretelling six more weeks of winter, or will his absence of a shadow herald an early spring?
https://tinyurl.com/Wiarton-Willie
Image: https://tinyurl.com/Wiarton-Willie-Photo</cmt>
